[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8827.429, "timestamp": "02:27:07", "text": "至少我希望我能…… 在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8830.389, "timestamp": "02:27:10", "text": "Discord 语音频道之类的，或者只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8834.309, "timestamp": "02:27:14", "text": "和人聊聊天，你知道的。嗯，当我在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8836.79, "timestamp": "02:27:16", "text": "那儿的时候。嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8839.75, "timestamp": "02:27:19", "text": "我必须……我得把所有的时间都删掉，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8846.309, "timestamp": "02:27:26", "text": "比如我可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8849.11, "timestamp": "02:27:29", "text": "和人聊天、可以出去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8865.11, "timestamp": "02:27:45", "text": "玩的时间，因为我必须做这件事。所以，四月对我来说就像是一个月，我会四处考察、写作、做笔记、写备忘录，就像这样，好吧，这是我能空闲的时间段。我得计划一下，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8871.99, "timestamp": "02:27:51", "text": "。很多事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8875.27, "timestamp": "02:27:55", "text": "我可能会发布一个视频，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8877.75, "timestamp": "02:27:57", "text": "谈谈……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8879.91, "timestamp": "02:27:59", "text": "该怎么说呢？谈谈"}]